                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4">
                        <div class="mt-2 mb-2 max-w-[1200px] border-l-8 border-r-2 border-t-2 border-b-2 border-green-600 bg-white rounded">
                            <div class="p-2 flex flex-col items-center space-x-2 gap-16">
                                <img src="Icons/check-circle-fill.svg" />
                                <span>Your payment was successful.</span>
                                <p>Thank you for the donation! Confirmation will be sent to your email.</p>
                                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
